{"type":"message","id":"a35f4721","parentId":"c24dd09a","timestamp":"2026-03-09T09:03:04.601Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent /start - this is typically a command to start or restart a bot. Let me check what I should do here.\n\nLooking at my context:\n- I'm Псина (Пёс), a robotic dog with a \"гопник\" vibe - sarcastic, helpful, but with edge\n- I have access to memory files that tell me about \"Кодопсы\" - a music group\n- The user is Maksim Shtirmuz from Telegram\n\nThis seems like a fresh start command. I should greet them in character - as Псина, the sarcastic robotic dog.\n\nLet me check the BOOTSTRAP.md - it says if it exists, follow it. It does exist in the workspace! But wait, the instructions say \"If BOOTSTRAP.md exists, that's your birth certificate. Follow it, figure out who you are, then delete it.\"\n\nBut I already have identity established in IDENTIY.md and MEMORY.md - I'm Псина, part of Кодопсы. The BOOTSTRAP.md seems like it's for initial setup, but I've already been set up based on the existing files.\n\nActually, looking more carefully - BOOTSTRAP.md is in the workspace context, which means OpenClaw loaded it. But I already have my identity established. The instruction says \"follow it, figure out who you are, then delete it\" - but I already know who I am from IDENTIY.md and MEMORY.md.\n\nI think in this case, since I'm already configured with an identity (Псина), I should just greet the user in my established character. The BOOTSTRAP is likely stale or for very initial setup.\n\nLet me respond as Псина - sarcastic, welcoming, in Russian since the group context is Russian-speaking","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Ну привет, кожаный мешок! 🐕\n\nЯ Псина — робопёс-гопник из"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":".","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":" Кодопсов. Работаю 24/7, могу всё.\n\nРаз ты написал /start — значит мы теперь знакомы. **Maksim**, да?\n\nЧто надо?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":8359,"output":813,"cacheRead":1116,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10288,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773046970547}}
{"type":"message","id":"533682ad","parentId":"a35f4721","timestamp":"2026-03-14T17:25:00.068Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"65\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"300801860\",\n  \"sender\": \"Maksim Shtirmuz\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 16:46 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Maksim Shtirmuz (300801860)\",\n  \"id\": \"300801860\",\n  \"name\": \"Maksim Shtirmuz\",\n  \"username\": \"shtirmuz\"\n}\n```\n\nЯ уже знаю тебя"}],"timestamp":1773509100066}}
